SQLite3 Multiple Ciphers (https://github.com/utelle/SQLite3MultipleCiphers),
Copyright (c) 2006-2026 Ulrich Telle, MIT licence, is linked statically into
every worker binary. It is not committed here: build.sh fetches
  sqlite3mc-2.7.1-sqlite-3.54.1-amalgamation.zip
from the project's v2.7.1 release and refuses it unless its SHA-256 is
  d6bc59678e015c5ac6d3ec5d7b657c351230b36c8052b185e446c9d52ba01af0
(sqlite3mc.sha256; the same value as the release's SHA256SUMS), then
compiles sqlite3mc_amalgamation.c with:
  -O2 -fPIC -DSQLITE_ENABLE_RTREE -DSQLITE_THREADSAFE=1 -DHAVE_USLEEP=1
  -DSQLITE_ENABLE_FTS3 -DSQLITE_ENABLE_FTS3_PARENTHESIS -DSQLITE_OMIT_DEPRECATED
  -DSQLITE_DEFAULT_WAL_SYNCHRONOUS=1 -DSQLITE_ENABLE_UPDATE_DELETE_LIMIT
  -DSQLITE_USE_URI=1
